---
description: "Constants. Read before writing or changing frontend code."
globs: frontend/src/**/*.js, frontend/src/**/*.ts, frontend/src/**/*.json
alwaysApply: false
---

# Constants

- Enums, statuses, labels, limits and `PERMISSIONS` come from `src/constants.json`. Import them instead of redefining them.
- Never hand-edit `src/constants.json`: it is generated by `npm run fetch-constants`.
- Never add a fallback to a constants value (no `constants.X || 'foo'`, no `?? 10`).
